window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What if courage was your only option?</b> </p> <p>Having been forced into a new world, Kallie find herself surrounded by vampires. With her father being the victim of continued brutal attacks by his own kind, she's desperate for help. </p> <p>Liam, the city's top detective, and a Blue Blood refuses, the situation officially out of his hands and not his problem. </p> <p>A Red Blood vampire, Caleb, steps up and has sworn to protect her, but is ineffective at stopping the violence of his people. </p> <p>When the raging feud between the Red Bloods and Blue Bloods spills into her home, Kallie is forced in the middle of it. Torn between love and family loyalty, she must find the courage to fight what she fears the most and risk everything, even if it means losing herself in the process. </p>"; 
